// title: The art of Knowing Your SIEM & XDR Data · New sub-tables Defender For Endpoint
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceEvents, DeviceFileCertificateInfo, DeviceFileEvents, DeviceInfo, DeviceLogonEvents, DeviceNetworkEvents, DeviceProcessEvents, DeviceRegistryEvents
// purpose: The art of Knowing Your SIEM & XDR Data · New sub-tables Defender For Endpoint
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Learning/TheArtOfKnowingYourData.md
// kind: repo
